GIVEN e IS AN `Event in the life of a person`
      person IS A `Person who may have become bankrupt`
      `the day on which the event happened` IS A DATE
      `the day on which the question is asked` IS A DATE
      `a contrary intention appears` IS A BOOLEAN
      selecting IS A `Which day selects the text for Article 8` TYPICALLY `the day of the event`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 8: on the day of the event and the day of the question, the event is a person becoming bankrupt` e person `the day on which the event happened` `the day on which the question is asked` `a contrary intention appears` selecting MEANS
    `Article 8: the event is a person becoming bankrupt`
        (`the text of the Law in force on` (`the day that selects the text of Article 8` selecting `the day on which the event happened` `the day on which the question is asked`))
        e person `a contrary intention appears`
